    {
      "name": "git-commit",
      "title": {
        "en": "Git Commit",
        "zh": "提交改动"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Create or rewrite Git commits: the create chain scopes the change, stages precisely, writes a Chinese Conventional Commit message, and verifies the result; the edit chain fixes omissions, rewrites messages, splits, squashes, and reorders unpushed commits. Use when the user says 提交, commit, write a commit message, amend the last commit, split into two commits, or squash these commits — even without mentioning Conventional Commits, as long as the intent is to create or rewrite a commit.",
        "zh": "在 Git 仓库里生成或改写提交：生成链判断改动边界、精确暂存、写中文 Conventional Commit 并复核；编辑链负责补漏、改信息、拆分、合并与调整未推送提交的顺序。用户说「提交」「commit 一下」「写个提交信息」「补一下刚才那次提交」「拆成两个提交」「合并成一次」时使用——即使没提 Conventional Commit，只要意图是创建一次提交或改写已有提交，就应触发。"
      },
