    {
      "name": "write-openapi-json",
      "title": {
        "en": "Write OpenAPI JSON",
        "zh": "编写接口契约"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Generate, revise, or review Apifox-importable OpenAPI 3.1 JSON from real code within the scope the user names: everything inlined, no components or $ref, 200 responses only, and Chinese descriptions plus examples on every field. The edit chain covers single-file field changes and cross-file moves or merges; review mode reports issues without touching files. Use when the user asks to write OpenAPI, build an Apifox import file, author an API contract JSON, add missing response fields, document endpoints from code, or review an existing contract.",
        "zh": "按用户指定范围，从真实代码生成、修订或审阅可导入 Apifox 的 OpenAPI 3.1 JSON：字段全部内联、不写 components 与 $ref、只写 200 响应、每个字段带中文说明与示例；修订链支持单文件内改字段与跨文件迁移合并，审阅模式只出问题清单不改文件。用户要求编写 OpenAPI、Apifox 导入文件、接口契约 JSON、补充接口返回字段、按代码整理接口文档或审阅已有契约时使用。"
      },
