    {
      "name": "write-knowledge-doc",
      "title": {
        "en": "Write Knowledge Doc",
        "zh": "写知识文档"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turn technical knowledge into searchable knowledge documents, and read or revise existing ones. Three chains: generate (one concept per entry, written on a fixed five-section skeleton — problem, solution, concrete scenario, boundaries, related concepts — with frontmatter for kind, status, verified, and applies_to), understand (answer reader questions from the document alone; also serves as acceptance for the generate chain), and edit (revise facts, add sections, split or merge entries, update status and links). Use when the user asks to organize knowledge or notes, write a knowledge doc, digest an unfamiliar concept, or file materials and links into a knowledge base; also when they ask what a given entry says, whether they can follow it, or to revise or split an existing entry. Trigger even if the word “document” never appears, as long as the intent is to turn a class of knowledge into a searchable document, understand it, or revise it.",
        "zh": "把技术知识沉淀成可检索的知识文档，并负责读懂与修订已有文档。三条链：生成（一篇一个概念，按「1. 它解决什么问题 → 2. 它怎么解决的 → 3. 一个具体场景 → 4. 边界与例外 → 5. 相关概念」骨架成文，frontmatter 用 kind 定模式、status 定成熟度、verified 定核实状态、applies_to 定适用版本与环境）、理解（只凭文档回答读者问题，同时充当生成链的验收）、编辑（改事实、补章节、拆分合并、更新状态与链接）。当用户要求整理知识、整理笔记、写知识文档、消化陌生概念、把资料或链接沉淀进知识库，或要求「这篇讲了什么」「能不能照着做」「改一下这篇条目」「拆成两篇」时使用——即使没明说「文档」，只要意图是把一类知识沉淀成可检索文档、读懂它或修订它，就应触发。"
      },
      "author": "xiechenghua01",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/xiechenghua01/skills/tree/main/write-knowledge-doc",
      "repository": "https://github.com/xiechenghua01/skills",
