    {
      "name": "ste",
      "title": {
        "en": "STE",
        "zh": "简化技术中文"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Controlled writing and review rules for Simplified Technical Chinese (STE-ZH), localized from ASD-STE100. Three chains: generate (write controlled text for requirements, code comments, ADRs, and reports), understand (diagnose violations without editing), and edit (rewrite from the issue list and re-check). Two strength levels: pragmatic and strict. Trigger when the user types ste or STE, or asks for simplified technical Chinese, ambiguity-free requirements, standardized code comments and error assertions, quantified ADR decisions, reports that separate execution from verification, or a review of technical prose.",
        "zh": "基于 ASD-STE100 本土化的简化技术中文（STE-ZH）受控写作与审查规范。三条链：生成（按需求下发、代码注释、ADR、汇报四种文体写受控文本）、理解（只诊断出违规清单不改）、编辑（按清单改写并复检）。分 pragmatic 与 strict 两档强度。用户输入触发词 ste、STE，或要求使用简化技术中文、消除需求歧义、规范代码注释与错误断言、写定量 ADR、输出执行与验证解耦的汇报、审阅技术文本时使用。"
      },
