    {
      "name": "skill-development",
      "title": {
        "en": "Skill Development",
        "zh": "技能开发"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Create, edit, and understand Agent Skills. Use for turning a workflow into a skill, writing SKILL.md, improving skill triggers, workflows, scripts or tests, and explaining or reviewing existing skills. Proceed on clear requirements; inspection is read-only by default. Not for ordinary application development, general documentation, or performing another skill's business task.",
        "zh": "新建、编辑与理解 Agent Skill。用户要求把流程整理成 skill、编写 SKILL.md、完善技能的触发条件/工作流/脚本/测试，或分析已有技能的用途、实现与缺陷时使用。清晰需求直接推进，理解默认只读；普通业务开发、一般文档写作、执行其他技能的业务任务不触发。"
      },
